# IQE-EXT-007: Tenable managed asset inventory
# Returns all assets currently tracked in Tenable.
# Use: asset discovery, coverage gap analysis, ATO boundary validation.
# Requires: tenable connector configured with access_key + secret_key.

foreach a in ext.tenable.assets
select a.id, a.fqdn, a.ipv4, a.operating_system, a.last_seen
